# ClearWay Documentation Review

A comparison of the three project documents against the actual codebase, plus recommended next features.

---

## 1. Issues Found in Software_Design_Document.md

The design document is the most out-of-date file in the project.

### Factual Errors / Missing Content

| Issue | Current Doc Says | Reality in Code |
|---|---|---|
| **Auth system not mentioned** | User table only lists `id, name, email, fcm_token` | [User.java](file:///c:/Users/Bhuvan%20Chandran%20S/Downloads/ClearWay%20app/smart-routes-api/src/main/java/com/cleanroute/api/entity/User.java) has `passwordHash`, `salt`, and four `avoid_*` booleans |
| **AuthController missing** | Only lists `RouteController` | [AuthController.java](file:///c:/Users/Bhuvan%20Chandran%20S/Downloads/ClearWay%20app/smart-routes-api/src/main/java/com/cleanroute/api/controller/AuthController.java) exists with `/api/v1/auth/signup`, `/login`, `/preferences` |
| **TomTom not documented** | Says "Going to use OpenRouteService soon" | [TomTomRoutingClient.java](file:///c:/Users/Bhuvan%20Chandran%20S/Downloads/ClearWay%20app/smart-routes-api/src/main/java/com/cleanroute/api/service/integration/TomTomRoutingClient.java) is already implemented and active |
| **NotificationEngineService missing** | Not mentioned at all | [NotificationEngineService.java](file:///c:/Users/Bhuvan%20Chandran%20S/Downloads/ClearWay%20app/smart-routes-api/src/main/java/com/cleanroute/api/service/NotificationEngineService.java) exists and is called from RouteService |
| **Docker not mentioned** | No mention of containerization | The DB runs in Docker via [docker-compose.yml](file:///c:/Users/Bhuvan%20Chandran%20S/Downloads/ClearWay%20app/docker-compose.yml) on port 5434 |
| **Flyway not mentioned** | No migration strategy discussed | Two Flyway migrations exist under `db/migration/` |
| **Database schema incomplete** | Missing columns: `phone`, `preferred_channels`, `whatsapp_opt_in`, `password_hash`, `salt`, `avoid_*` flags, plus Routes is missing `distance_km`, `last_checked_at` | See [V1__init_schema.sql](file:///c:/Users/Bhuvan%20Chandran%20S/Downloads/ClearWay%20app/smart-routes-api/src/main/resources/db/migration/V1__init_schema.sql) and [V2__auth_and_allergies.sql](file:///c:/Users/Bhuvan%20Chandran%20S/Downloads/ClearWay%20app/smart-routes-api/src/main/resources/db/migration/V2__auth_and_allergies.sql) |
| **Route_Metrics schema incomplete** | Missing `traffic_index` and `temperature` columns | Present in V1 migration |
| **Flow description outdated** | Says "user clicks start and end point, backend saves as LineString" | Backend now queries TomTom for up to 3 road-snapped alternatives, scores each with per-pollutant data, and returns ranked results |

### Structural Gaps

- No mention of the `dto/`, `util/`, `config/`, or `repository/` packages.
- No API endpoint table (the doc should list all REST endpoints with methods, paths, and payloads).
- The "personal commentary" style ("really enjoying learning postgis") should be replaced with neutral technical language.

